{%- doc -%}
  VOLKARA icon set — 24 × 24 grid, round caps/joins, stroke = currentColor.
  Spec names: arrow-right arrow-left arrow-up-right arrow-down chevron-down chevron-up chevron-left chevron-right
  plus minus close menu search cart bag user check x star shield truck return flame leaf layers thermometer sparkle
  play pause heart lock mail phone map-pin clock info globe filter sliders grid grid-2 list zoom hexagon drop utensils
  award gift eye dishwasher induction oven fire-ring weight warranty instagram facebook tiktok youtube pinterest x-twitter
  Extras: trash share link external calendar chat quote alert check-circle help pan pot knife ruler ban package
  credit-card refresh logout edit download spoon

  @param {string} name - Icon name (see list above). Unknown names render nothing.
  @param {number} [size] - Rendered width/height in px. Default 20.
  @param {string} [class] - Extra CSS classes.
  @param {number} [stroke] - Stroke width in 24-unit space. Default 1.5.

  @example
  {% render 'vk-icon', name: 'arrow-right', size: 18 %}
{%- enddoc -%}
